        comment Comment1 START ENEL 585 Project E - single-phase reactive power support, HIL plant (no control). Transformer secondary phase-to-neutral, 20.2-21.2 V rms.<br>Startup: S open (DC resistor off), Bbp open -> close B2 (diodes charge C_dc through R_pc) -> close Bbp -> PWM; switch S as the demonstration needs.<br>Edit R_load (and the assumed R_tx, L_tx) in Model Settings > Model initialization, then recompile. ENDCOMMENT 
        [
            position = 6336, 7648
        ]

        comment Comment2 START Q1/Q2 (leg a, on L_boost): DI1 top, DI2 bottom<br>Q3/Q4 (leg b, on the neutral): DI3 top, DI4 bottom ENDCOMMENT 
        [
            position = 7688, 7744
        ]

